  "description": "Luanti 5.18 (open-source voxel engine) with Minetest Game for KaiOS 4.0: real threads on SharedArrayBuffer, OffscreenCanvas render thread, frames as transferred ImageBitmaps, WebGL 2 or 1, engine converted to JavaScript with wasm2js (no WebAssembly).",
